The cycle baseline is `ad9bcbef`, where the two INBOX-46 Part 1 closures are
still provisional and report-all is 443 selected / 258 emitting / 185
failing. Captured compiler_rt IR md5 is
`b0eda7a6427c3084fdf096a68696f19c`; the stage4 Zig pin is
